Lume GF: every build hands the channel-change log (gfZapLog, 0001) to KSOptions.gfZapReport, which Lume GF writes into
its diagnostic report ("Zap: ..."), and two more steps are logged: a stream's first picture on screen and the moment
it can play. The lines' times show where a channel change spends its time (Georgs, 26 Oct 2026: switching "feels like
it could be faster"). Made against KSPlayer bdfa2da (deps/KSPlayer/REVISION) with 0001 and 0002 applied.

